  <book-part book-part-type="chapter">
    <book-part-meta><title-group><title>Exampletinib</title></title-group></book-part-meta>
    <body>
      <sec id="article-9001.s1" sec-type="pubmed-excerpt"><title>Continuing Education Activity</title>
        <p>Exampletinib is an oral multikinase inhibitor used for solid tumours.</p></sec>
      <sec id="article-9001.s2" sec-type="Mechanism of Action"><title>Mechanism of Action</title>
        <p>Exampletinib binds the ATP pocket of VEGFR2 and inhibits its phosphorylation.</p>
        <sec id="article-9001.s2.1"><title>Selectivity</title><p>It also inhibits FGFR1 at higher concentrations.</p></sec></sec>
      <sec id="article-9001.s3"><title>References</title><p>Ignored reference text.</p></sec>
    </body>
  </book-part>
